{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Final Fall</strong> is a psychological horror game about schizophrenia, trauma, and the monsters we carry inside. You play as <strong>Ophelia</strong>, a woman with no memory after a failed suicide attempt\u2014lost in a crumbling asylum filled with hallucinations, riddles, and voices that won\u2019t stop whispering.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore a world shaped by Ophelia\u2019s fractured mind. As her sanity slips, the hospital twists around her\u2014walls bend, whispers grow louder, and reality becomes impossible to trust. Solve brutal puzzles, survive disturbing hallucinations, and confront terrifying creatures born from her guilt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Suicide isn\u2019t just a backstory</strong>, it\u2019s a mechanic. Misusing items or failing in key moments may push Ophelia to end her life. Do it three times\u2026 and your save file is permanently deleted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599470/extras/InsanityGIF.gif?t=1745497314\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Core Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Sanity-Driven World</strong> \u2013 The hospital reacts to Ophelia\u2019s mental state, changing the environment as her mind deteriorates.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hallucinatory Enemies</strong> \u2013 Monsters aren\u2019t real\u2026 or are they? Fight distorted manifestations of her trauma.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Resource Scarcity</strong> \u2013 Pills and healing items are rare. Use them wisely, or suffer the consequences.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Advanced Puzzles</strong> \u2013 Decode Morse code, solve twisted riddles, and manipulate real instruments like a completely playable piano. (Yes you can actually play piano)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Permanent Death System</strong> \u2013 Suicides can cut Ophelia's story short, ending her story and taking your save file along with it.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Can you survive her mind?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3599470?t=1745497314","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3599470?t=1745497314","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599470/e0dde36818c19a440fbbb12747a57521774a266e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745497314","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599470/e0dde36818c19a440fbbb12747a57521774a266e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745497314","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,2,5],"notes":"Violence and Gore: The game features graphic depictions of violence, including dismemberment, blood, and grotesque imagery. Players may encounter scenes involving mutilation and disturbing physical violence.\r\nPsychological Distress: The game explores themes of mental illness, trauma, and guilt, featuring unsettling hallucinations, disturbing voices, and other elements that contribute to the protagonist\u2019s psychological unraveling. Players will experience intense psychological horror that may be emotionally distressing.\r\nDeath and Suicide: The narrative touches on dark themes of death and suicidal ideation, focusing on the emotional and psychological consequences of these events.\r\nDisturbing Imagery: The game features moments of unsettling visuals, including grotesque monsters, decaying environments, and other horrific scenes that may cause emotional discomfort.\r\nSubstance Abuse: The game contains references to psychotropic drug use and medication as part of the protagonist's struggle with mental health issues."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Final Fall</strong> is a psychological horror game about schizophrenia, trauma, and the monsters we carry inside. You play as <strong>Ophelia</strong>, a woman with no memory after a failed suicide attempt\u2014lost in a crumbling asylum filled with hallucinations, riddles, and voices that won\u2019t stop whispering.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore a world shaped by Ophelia\u2019s fractured mind. As her sanity slips, the hospital twists around her\u2014walls bend, whispers grow louder, and reality becomes impossible to trust. Solve brutal puzzles, survive disturbing hallucinations, and confront terrifying creatures born from her guilt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Suicide isn\u2019t just a backstory</strong>, it\u2019s a mechanic. Misusing items or failing in key moments may push Ophelia to end her life. Do it three times\u2026 and your save file is permanently deleted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599470/extras/InsanityGIF.gif?t=1745497314\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Core Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Sanity-Driven World</strong> \u2013 The hospital reacts to Ophelia\u2019s mental state, changing the environment as her mind deteriorates.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hallucinatory Enemies</strong> \u2013 Monsters aren\u2019t real\u2026 or are they? Fight distorted manifestations of her trauma.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Resource Scarcity</strong> \u2013 Pills and healing items are rare. Use them wisely, or suffer the consequences.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Advanced Puzzles</strong> \u2013 Decode Morse code, solve twisted riddles, and manipulate real instruments like a completely playable piano. (Yes you can actually play piano)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Permanent Death System</strong> \u2013 Suicides can cut Ophelia's story short, ending her story and taking your save file along with it.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Can you survive her mind?</p>","developers":["Emmanouil Kaparos Kaparakis"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599470/2dd6980da84201ce2f29fe6edde13732b3ef97cf/header.jpg?t=1745497314","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257126777,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257126777/movie480.mp4?t=1744815065","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257126777/movie_max.mp4?t=1744815065"},"name":"Final Fall Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257126777/7c7fe5984eb4a789d2c43f839116a2aec0834da9/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1744815065","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257126777/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1744815065","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257126777/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1744815065"}}],"name":"Final Fall","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 x64<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Ryzen 2600x,  Intel i5 8600k <br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GTX 1060, AMD RX 580<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 20 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 x64<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Ryzen 5600x Intel i5-12400F or Better<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GTX 2070, RX 5700 XT or Better<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 20 GB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Emmanouil Kaparos Kaparakis"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Viol\u00eancia Extrema\nTemas sens\u00edveis\nNudez","rating":"18","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"18","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Drastische Gewalt\nAlkohol / Tabak\nSchimpfw\u00f6rte","rating":"18","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"18","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"30 May, 2025"},"required_age":0,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599470/d54e61793a7adec1da4e290a24114647bd7c25f7/ss_d54e61793a7adec1da4e290a24114647bd7c25f7.1920x1080.jpg?t=1745497314","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599470/d54e61793a7adec1da4e290a24114647bd7c25f7/ss_d54e61793a7adec1da4e290a24114647bd7c25f7.600x338.jpg?t=1745497314"},{"id":1,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599470/dc971c40d478ad9d4147e0b328e32cab4c25ec5a/ss_dc971c40d478ad9d4147e0b328e32cab4c25ec5a.1920x1080.jpg?t=1745497314","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599470/dc971c40d478ad9d4147e0b328e32cab4c25ec5a/ss_dc971c40d478ad9d4147e0b328e32cab4c25ec5a.600x338.jpg?t=1745497314"},{"id":2,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599470/9595feb33d57b2caee340d7cd925c9050554fdcc/ss_9595feb33d57b2caee340d7cd